# Current career save: title -> Career -> Resume Career -> Safe House -> free roam.
# Stop front-end input as soon as the safe-house package loads. Repeated accepts
# past that point cancel the default-No confirmation instead of leaving the garage.
# Settle 10 seconds and use 250ms taps: current metal360 package cold drive PASS.
# Sequence: A, Left to Yes, A. Long accepts can consume the confirmation.
duration_s = 560
players = 1
pad1 = 115-116:start, 135-136:start, 147-148:a, 160-161:a, 0:until_log "CAREER_SAFEHOUSE.LZC" 240, 10-10.25:a, 13-13.25:left, 16-16.25:a, 0:until_log "INGAMEB.LZC" 120, 0-200:rt
